# Listening-study material: 16 blinded mp3s and the key that maps them back to the recordings.
# Regenerate with `python -m ecgmusic.build_study`, which is deterministic. KEY.csv is NOT
# committed on purpose: this repository is public, so publishing it would let a participant look
# up which clip is which and the study would no longer be blind.
output/listening_study/
